      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Not Achieved\n1) Load on db (latency) (read = need to scan full table and for write scan full table for existent url))\n2) SPO (DB or service)\n3) Not unique after some number of\ntinyUrls (Db sequence has limitation (reset to zero))\n4) Collision tiny url",
      "autoResize": true,
