      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How this global counter(redis) work well\n1) single threaded and all operations are atomic\n2) Perform well in distrubted enviorment \n\nProcess\n1) get global counter value\n2) XOR with private key \n3) encode with base62\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
