      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "More improvment\n1) Replace cache wit CDN for tiny url cache data so \nget tinyUrl and redirection become\nfaster in microsecond \n\nwhy \nCDN is useful to cache static data\nbut again, the cost of storing data in cache become a problem so we need to be sure it fit in all condition/factors ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "More improvment\n1) Replace cache wit CDN for tiny url cache data so \nget tinyUrl and redirection become\nfaster in microsecond \n\nwhy \nCDN is useful to cache static data\nbut again, the cost of storing data in cache become a problem so we need to be sure it fit in all condition/factors ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
