      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777825712780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Missing \n1) scale  -> (QPS,storage,cache hit)\n2) ID gen -> bas62, collision, Distributed safe\n3) DB -> Schema + hashing + sharding + replica\n+ consistency\n4) cache -> key, TTL, LRU, \n5) Reliability -> Failover, retries, cache fallback\n6) Flows -> clear read/write paths\n7) CDN -> edge catchinh\n8) tradeoff-> ID, consistency, caching\n9) Abuse -> Rate limiting, validation ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Missing \n1) scale  -> (QPS,storage,cache hit)\n2) ID gen -> bas62, collision, Distributed safe\n3) DB -> Schema + hashing + sharding + replica + consistency\n4) cache -> key, TTL, LRU, \n5) Reliability -> Failover, retries, cache fallback\n6) Flows -> clear read/write paths\n7) CDN -> edge catchinh\n8) tradeoff-> ID, consistency, caching\n9) Abuse -> Rate limiting, validation ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
