      "updated": 1777825721512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow\n1) Requirements (functional + non-functional)\n2) Scale estimation (QPS, storage, latency)\n3) Entities\n4) API endpoints\n5) High-level design (boxes)\n6) Read/write flows\n7) Deep dive (ID generation, DB sharding, cache)\n8) Tradeoffs\n9) Reliability (failover, retries, fallback)\n10) Scale improvements (CDN, multi-region, hot keys)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow\n1) Requirements (functional + non-functional)\n2) Scale estimation (QPS, storage, latency)\n3) Entities\n4) API endpoints\n5) High-level design (boxes)\n6) Read/write flows\n7) Deep dive (ID generation, DB sharding, cache)\n8) Tradeoffs\n9) Reliability (failover, retries, fallback)\n10) Scale improvements (CDN, multi-region, hot keys)",
      "autoResize": false,
